ps://www.billboard.com/business/business-news/top-music-business-schools-2023-list-1235437174/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d16\"},\"ref\":\"d16\",\"snippet\":\" ... the fiercely passionate creative is an entrepreneur in her own right. \\\"I'm the CEO and founder of a company that's directed over 25 features,\\\" she says. \\\"At the end of the day, I am Elon's sister and Kimbal's sister and Maye's daughter. But ... \",\"title\":\"https://variety.com/2024/film/news/passionflix-tosca-musk-streamer-1236256897/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d12\"},\"ref\":\"d12\",\"snippet\":\" ... Animation in 2001)\\n** Ruby-Spears Enterprises - An animation studio, and former sister company of Hanna-Barbera (Libraries are owned by Warner Bros. Animation)\\n* New Line Cinema - a film production company (became separate unit of Time Warner upon close of sale; folded into WB in 2008)\\n* Turner Entertainment Co ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turner_Broadcasting_System\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"0c718addfbf857cdf8364774a8396492ff16a70adba779e0d22e3649bb3f5bc1\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"bc8d727d703a830e4ce7d7429c6dc001417bdca888871de26519caf97ad30132\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"film streaming service co-founder sister of CEO\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_2d99f2fc68144faabcf04a24"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ran