was mostly under the care of nannies. \\\"The first child was too much with nannies and died ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.hindustantimes.com/world-news/us-news/elon-musks-dad-makes-cruel-claims-about-tesla-ceos-first-son-nevada-alexanders-tragic-death-hes-gonna-shoot-me-101739553927980.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d27\"},\"ref\":\"d27\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2022-11-29\\n---\\nElon Musk's ex-wife refutes his claim that firstborn child died in his arms\\n\\nElon Musk's first wife, Justine Musk, has disputed the Twitter boss's account of their first-born's death, claiming that it was her — and not him — who was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/news/elon-musk-ex-wife-pushes-052845910.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d28\"},\"ref\":\"d28\",\"snippet\":\" ... I have no mercy for anyone who would use the deaths of children for gain, politics or fame.\\\"\\n\\nA follower quote-tweeted this and asked Mr Musk if the death of Nevada was from SIDS [Sudden infant death syndrome].\\n\\nThe tech billionaire's ex-wife responded to the ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/americas/justine-musk-elon-musk-dying-son-b2234938.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her first son passed away at a young age\\n\\nTwo years after getting married, Justine and Elon welcomed their first child together, Nevada Alexander, in 2002. Shortly after his birth, he passed away from sudden infant death syndrome (SIDS).\\n\\n\\\"Nevada went down for a nap, placed on his ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/human-interest/who-is-justine-musk-elon-musk-ex-wife/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... Saxon, Damian and Nevada\\n\\nMusk and his first wife, Justine Wilson, had twins Griffin and Vivian in 2004 after the couple had a son named Nevada in 2002 who died at just 10 weeks old from sudden infant death syndrome (SIDS).\\n\\nWhile Musk has rarely mentioned his loss ... \",\"title\":\"https://nypost.com/2024/06/23/us-news/elon-musks-12-kids-and-counting-what-to-know-about-the-tesla-billionaires-big-brood/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... Nevada Alexander\\n\\nMusk welcomed his son, Nevada Alexander, with his first wife, Justine Wilson in 2002. Sadly, at 10 weeks old, he passed away from sudden infant death syndrome (SIDS).\\n\\n\\\"Nevada went down for a nap, placed on his back as always, and stopped breathing,\\\" Wilson wrote in ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/all-about-elon-musk-children-11678749\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d32\"},\"ref\":\"d32\",\"snippet\":\" ... Saying His Child Was 'Killed'\\n\\nAfter the horror of losing a baby (his first son, Nevada Alexander Musk, died of SIDS in 2002 at just 10 weeks old), you would think Elon Musk would be a little more sensitive about the death of a child. But this is ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.yahoo.com/entertainment/elon-musk-sparks-backlash-incorrectly-193432795.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1f1157311531008f1603bca7364ab5b37d68530481b0dceead32e25530f270be\",\"replay_requested\":fals